OL,3,GNEWSASouth West: Recovery after
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, first responders and
OL,7,Ftransport companies in Devon and
OL,8,FCornwall experienced disruption during
OL,9,Fa national Microsoft outage.
OL,11,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot
OL,12,Fwere affected and Microsoft said
OL,13,Fattempts to fix the issue had not gone
OL,14,Fas expected, with the outage lasting
OL,15,Fmore than 20 hours.
OL,17,FMicrosoft said the outage was not a
OL,18,Fcyber-security incident and was caused
OL,19,Fby a technical issue. It has apologised
OL,20,Ffor the disruption.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
