OL,3,GNEWSASouth West: Recovery after
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Devon NHS Trust said it had been
OL,7,Funable to access emails but was running
OL,8,Fappointments and critical services as
OL,9,Fnormal and Cornwall Council had asked
OL,10,Fpeople who experienced delays getting
OL,11,Fthrough to its contact centre to "bear
OL,12,Fwith us".
